---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Header from "../../components/Header.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Dobre Vode">
  <Header />

  <main class="mt-12 mb-24 px-4">
    <!-- PAPER CARD -->
    <section
      class="
        relative
        w-full
        max-w-sm
        sm:max-w-md
        md:max-w-lg
        lg:max-w-xl
        xl:max-w-2xl
        mx-auto

        rounded-xl
        bg-[#f3e6cf]
        shadow-[0_20px_70px_rgba(0,0,0,0.6)]
        border
        border-black/10
        text-center
      "
    >
      <!-- NAILS -->
      <span class="absolute top-3 left-3 w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-[#4b4b4b] shadow-[inset_0_1px_1px_rgba(255,255,255,0.4),0_2px_4px_rgba(0,0,0,0.6)]"></span>
      <span class="absolute top-3 right-3 w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-[#4b4b4b] shadow-[inset_0_1px_1px_rgba(255,255,255,0.4),0_2px_4px_rgba(0,0,0,0.6)]"></span>
      <span class="absolute bottom-3 left-3 w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-[#4b4b4b] shadow-[inset_0_1px_1px_rgba(255,255,255,0.4),0_2px_4px_rgba(0,0,0,0.6)]"></span>
      <span class="absolute bottom-3 right-3 w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-[#4b4b4b] shadow-[inset_0_1px_1px_rgba(255,255,255,0.4),0_2px_4px_rgba(0,0,0,0.6)]"></span>

      <!-- INNER CONTENT -->
      <div class="px-8 sm:px-10 md:px-12 lg:px-16 py-16 sm:py-20">
        <!-- TITLE -->
        <h1
          class="
            text-3xl
            sm:text-4xl
            lg:text-5xl
            tracking-wide
            mb-14

            text-[#7a1f1f]        /* dark red */
            font-renfrew          /* Renfrew font */
          "
        >
          Restaurant Dobre Vode
        </h1>

        <img
          src="/images/spec2.jpg"
          alt="Restaurant atmosphere"
          class="
            w-full
            rounded-lg
            shadow-[0_10px_30px_rgba(0,0,0,0.4)]
            border
            border-black/10
            mb-20
          "
        />

        <!-- STORY -->
        <div
          class="
            space-y-9
            text-[#3a2818]
            text-base
            sm:text-lg
            lg:text-xl
            leading-relaxed
            font-light
          "
        >
          <p class="italic text-lg sm:text-xl lg:text-2xl text-[#2a1d13]/90">
            Dobro došli u naš restoran.
          </p>

          <p>
            Naša priča počinje davne 2000. godine, na obali rijeke Tare. Tada smo
            imali samo četiri stola, veliku želju i još veću ljubav prema domaćoj
            hrani i gostoprimstvu.
          </p>

          <p>
            Korak po korak, zahvaljujući vjernim gostima koji su nam se iznova
            vraćali, rasli smo zajedno sa njima. Danas, naš restoran može da ugosti
            preko 100 osoba, ali je duh sa samog početka ostao isti – toplina,
            iskren osmijeh i osjećaj da ste došli na pravo mjesto.
          </p>

          <p class="pt-12 font-medium text-[#2a1d13] text-lg sm:text-xl lg:text-2xl">
            Hvala vam što ste dio naše priče.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- IMAGES -->
        <div class="mt-16 flex flex-col gap-10">
          <img
            src="/images/spec1.jpg"
            alt="Traditional dish"
            class="
              w-full
              rounded-lg
              shadow-[0_10px_30px_rgba(0,0,0,0.4)]
              border
              border-black/10
            "
          />
        </div>
		<div class="mt-16 flex flex-col gap-10">
          <img
            src="/images/rest1.jpeg"
            alt="Traditional dish"
            class="
              w-full
              rounded-lg
              shadow-[0_10px_30px_rgba(0,0,0,0.4)]
              border
              border-black/10
            "
          />
        </div>
		<div class="mt-16 flex flex-col gap-10">
          <img
            src="/images/sala1.jpeg"
            alt="Traditional dish"
            class="
              w-full
              rounded-lg
              shadow-[0_10px_30px_rgba(0,0,0,0.4)]
              border
              border-black/10
            "
          />
        </div>
		<div class="mt-16 flex flex-col gap-10">
          <img
            src="/images/rest2.jpeg"
            alt="Traditional dish"
            class="
              w-full
              rounded-lg
              shadow-[0_10px_30px_rgba(0,0,0,0.4)]
              border
              border-black/10
            "
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
